I go to the nearby supermarket.
I walk inside.
I take a plastic basket.
I want rice for the house.
I go to the rice section.
There are many packets on the shelf.
I see Matta rice.
It is the local red rice.
I like this red rice very much.
I take a small packet.
It is one kilo.
I want this for my daily meals.
I put that packet in the basket.
Now my basket has weight.
I want other things too.
I walk to the next section.
